 by }{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\b0\loch
Ashley L. Castillo}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
 \u8212\'97 an epic fantasy novel }
\par \pard\plain \s183\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\loch\ltrpar{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch
It's possible you're thinking of one of these and misremembered the author, or the title/author combination might be from a source that doesn't actually exist. If you can share where you heard about it, I can try to track down more specific details.}
\par \pard\plain \s183\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\loch\ltrpar\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs22\b0\loch

