: The page explicitly states JavaScript is disabled, so the actual "\uc2 \u1054\'84\'4f\u1089\'84\'83\u1090\'84\'84\u1072\'84\'70\u1085\'84\'7e\u1085\'84\'7e\uc1 \u1110\'3f \uc2 \u1085\'84\'7e\u1086\'84\'80\u1074\'84\'72\u1080\'84\'79\u1085\'84\'7e\u1080\'84\'79 \u1059\'84\'54\u1082\'84\'7b\u1088\'84\'82\u1072\'84\'70\uc1 \u1111\'3f\uc2 \u1085\'84\'7e\u1080\'84\'79" (Latest news of Ukraine) section \u8212\'81\'5c the main content \u8212\'81\'5c didn't render in what I fetched. \uc1 }
