\par \pard\plain \s183\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\tx0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi0\ltrpar{\rtlch\afs22\ab \ltrch\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\b\loch
Powerbeats Pro 2}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\fs22\b0\loch
 }{\loch
Built for movement, engineered for sound. Powerbeats Pro 2 pairs secure-fit ear hooks with premium audio, so they stay locked in through sprints, sets, and everything in between. Active Noise Cancellation blocks the outside world when you need focus; Transparency mode lets it back in when you don't. Heart rate sensing adds real-time training data without a separate device. Up to 10 hours of listening on a single charge, with fast-charge top-ups when you're short on time. Sweat and water resistant, seamlessly paired across your devices \uc2 \u8212\'81\'5c these are headphones that keep pace, not slow you down.\uc1 }
